# FOLIAGE-CLOUD-FLICKER: grass blades and the tree canopy against a cloudy sky must not flicker frame to frame
# (owner 10-30: "листва и трава конфилтуют на фоне облаков. постоянное мерцание"). Camera low, looking up past
# the blades into the canopy and the cloud deck; nothing moves between the paired shots, so any difference
# between 1_a/1_b (and 2_a/2_b, 30 frames later) at a foliage edge over the sky is the cloud reconstruction.
# Check: pixel diff of consecutive frames at foliage/grass edges over sky <= 2/255; clouds elsewhere unchanged
# vs a dev shot of the same steps.
Дано run Scene "Open Scene FIELD_Barn.desce"
Дано run View "View mode: Lit"
Дано run Entity "Sun"
Дано --subject selection set SunElevation 35
Дано --subject selection set SunAzimuth 110
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Position 0,40,2500
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0.15,0.25,-1
Тогда-вид 1_a camera at 0.4 m looking up: grass blades and canopy edges over clouds, crisp, no cloud on the blades
Тогда-вид 1_b the very next frame: identical to 1_a at every blade and leaf edge over the sky (<= 2/255)
# 30 presented frames between 1_b and 2_a: DesertCtl `frames 30` (SCN-VERBS op),
# answered by the editor after 30 presented frames; nothing is input, so neither camera nor TAA history moves.
Когда frames 30
Тогда-вид 2_a 30 frames later, same camera: identical to 1_a
Тогда-вид 2_b the next frame: identical to 2_a
